3. Training strategy: MSE loss, Adam/AdamW optimizer, lr ~0.001-0.005 with scheduler (ReduceLROnPlateau or cosine), early stopping on val loss, metrics MSE/MAE (standard in Long-term series forecasting), also RRSE/nRMSE maybe.
